  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "7.4.0: fixes async receive cancellation losing unreturned messages, preserves acknowledgement visibility leases until completion, restores async storage capacity accounting, and enforces physical disk flushes for durable async file writes and appends. 7.3.0: implements IAsyncMessageStore so the SQLite provider participates in ServiceMq's async API. No API changes. 7.2.0: updates Microsoft.Data.Sqlite to 10.0.12 and resolves the remaining SonarCloud code-smell findings (shared parameter-name constant); no API changes. Updates Microsoft.Data.Sqlite to 10.0.11, which clears the SQLitePCLRaw.lib.e_sqlite3 advisory GHSA-2m69-gcr7-jv3q carried by the 8.0.x line. Still targets netstandard2.0 and net8.0; no API changes.",
